    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA______________________________________________________________________________\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 20.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nRUBBER CONTROL (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 16 OF 2025\n\n[Certi\ufb01 ed on 22nd of August, 2025]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 22, 2025\n\nRubber Control (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2025\n\n1\n\nShort title\n\nGeneral Amendment to Chapter 436\n\nRepeal of section 26 of the principal enactment\n\n[Certified on 22nd of August, 2025]\n\nL. D. - O 31/2022\n\nAn Act to amend the Rubber Control Act\n\n(CHAPTER 436)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Rubber Control (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2025.\n\n2. (1) The Rubber Control Act (Chapter 436) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitution for the words, \u201cController\u201d and \u201cRubber Controller\u201d wherever such words appear in the principal enactment of the words, \u201cDirector-General\u201d.\n\n(2) Every reference to the \u201cController\u201d and \u201cRubber Controller\u201d in any other written law or in any notice, notification, contract, communication, form, other instrument or document shall from and after the date of commencement of this Act be read and construed as a reference made to the \u201cDirector-General of the Rubber Development Department\u201d.\n\n3. Section 26 of the principal enactment is hereby repealed.\n\n4. The heading appearing immediately after the words and figures \u201cPART VI\u201d of the principal enactment is hereby repealed and the following heading substituted therefor: -\n\n\u201cRUBBER ADVISORY BOARD\u201d.\n\nReplacement of heading in Part VI of the principal enactment"
