porated outside Sri Lanka, which carries on the business of banking within the meaning of the Banking Act, No.30 of 1988;\u201d; and\n\n(2) by the insertion immediately after the definitionof the expression \u201cdelivery\u201d, of the following newdefinitions: -\n\n\u201c\u201celectronic means\u201d shall mean any method by which information is generated, sent,\n\nShort title\n\nGeneral amendment to Chapter 82\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of the principal enactment\n\n2Bills of Exchange (Amendment) Act, No. 13 of 2025"
