    "chunk_text": "1Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)Act, No. 10 of 2025\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA______________________________________________________________________________\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 20.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nBUDGETARY RELIEF ALLOWANCE OF BUDGETARY RELIEF ALLOWANCE OF WORKERS (AMENDMENT) ACT, WORKERS (AMENDMENT) ACT, No.No. 10 OF 2025 10 OF 2025\n\n[Certified on 23rd of July, 2025]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri LankaDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka of July 25, 2025\n\n3Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)Act, No. 10 of 2025\n\n[Certified on 23rd of July, 2025]\n\nL.D.-O 19/2025\n\nAn Act to amend the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment) Act, No.10 of 2025.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to have come into operation on April 1, 2025.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016 is hereby amended as follows: -\n\n(1) in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for the words and figures \"With effect from May 1, 2015,\", of the words and figures \"For the period commencing on May 1, 2015 and ending on March 31, 2025, ''; and\n\n(2) in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution for the words and figures \"commencing from January 1, 2016\", of the words and figures \"for the period commencing on January 1, 2016 and ending on March 31, 2025,\".\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort titleand dateof operation"
