    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 30 OF 2023\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 17th of November, 2023]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of November 17, 2023\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 30 of 2023\n\nWS 6P L 01400806.09. 2023\n\nShort title\n\n[Certified on 17th of November, 2023]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 44/2022\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Amendment) Act, No. 30 of 2023.\n\n2.Section 28 of the Local Authorities ElectionsOrdinance (Chapter 262) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-\n\n(1)in subsection (2) of that section-\n\n(a)by the substitution for the words, \u201cshall consistof the number of candidates of whom\u201d of thewords, \u201cshall consist of the number ofcandidates of whom not less than twenty-fiveper centum of the total number of candidatesnominated in both the First Nomination Paperand the Additional Nomination Paper shall beyouth candidates and of whom,\u201d; and\n\n(b)by the substitution for the words, \u201cof such localauthority, substantially in the Forms set out inthe First Schedule, setting out the names-\u201d ofthe words, \u201cof such local authority. Thenomination papers submitted by everyrecognized political party or independentgroup in respect of all wards of any localauthority shall be substantially in the Formsset out in the First Schedule, setting out thenames-\u201d;\n\nAmendment ofsection 28 ofChapter 262\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 30 of 20232"
